# ------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub integration (contribution graph)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# The contribution graph fetches data from the GitHub GraphQL API
# directly from the browser without a token (best effort, subject to
# GitHub's unauthenticated rate limits). Results are cached for 24h
# in sessionStorage and an unavailable state is shown if the API
# cannot be reached.
#
# To raise the rate limit, run a server-side proxy and authenticate
# requests with a GitHub Personal Access Token. Set the token on the
# server only — NEVER expose GITHUB_TOKEN in browser/client code.
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_yourPersonalAccessTokenHere